  pocketRead: Routine nearby pockets usually pay out Abyssal Crystal.
  nodeRead: Heavier node clusters here usually lead to Rare Earth Dust.
  safePocketRead: Short relief spaces often still give Rare Earth Dust, so retreat
    is not empty.
  routeRead: Route anchors hint this biome's material line before the player fully
    commits.
  rareRead: The expensive late pull of this family usually resolves into Abyss Pressure
    Shell.
